# Local state Git ignores, which no package or render may read: the chart's
# content digest must not change with it (scripts/release_bom.py refuses a
# package storing a file Git ignores).
# `helm dependency update` writes the lock, with a timestamp, and an archive of
# each subchart, which would store its files a second time beside the
# subchart's directory; the chart's Python tests leave their caches.
Chart.lock
charts/*.tgz
# The files under helm/ that are not the chart, kept out of every package so a
# change to one changes no packaged file and takes no chart version: the
# tooling that deploys and tests the chart, the release values a deployment
# layers on it, and its render tests and their fixtures.
/Makefile
charts/*/Makefile
/scripts/
/tests/
charts/*/tests/
/fixtures/
/local-values.yaml
/bare-metal-release-values.yaml
/validation-capacity.toml
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.port-forward.pids
